{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c691","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae75-a6d1-7e71-949a-c0aa2731b1b5"},"sequence":419,"recorded_at":1780531400000833,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"37dc71c1-9569-4ea8-89d7-d279257fe1a3","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"37dc71c1-9569-4ea8-89d7-d279257fe1a3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"37dc71c1-9569-4ea8-89d7-d279257fe1a3"},"call_id":"call_01a0ae78de7b736a9eaaf7e274a61377","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-1oqfec/worktree/LOGBOOK.md`.\n1|# Flight Logbook\n2|\n3|> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n4|> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n5|\n6|## 2026-09-17\n7|\n8|### TASK-260830-2atgj4 — property-test the ownership reducer (final leaf)\n9|\n10|- SCOPE: executable proofs of the four story-pinned ownership invariants\n11|  (union-order independence, loser preservation, clock non-authority,\n12|  zero duplicate authorized owners) over `sessstate.Reduce`/`Compare`,\n13|  `sessrepo.WinningLease`/`ListLeases`, and `fencing.Authorize*`\n14|  (Sections 2.2, 5.3, 13.6-13.10, v0.6.0). Final leaf of\n15|  STORY-260830-1oqfec; carries the story-close traceability,\n16|  README, and registry re-pin items.\n17|- DEFECT (RED-first): `resolveWinner` reported each losing union lease\n18|  against the transient arrival-order winner, so a loser's\n19|  divergent-history evidence — even its presence — depended on union\n20|  order (witness: `{R@1, A@1}` on an empty chain reports the loss in\n21|  one arrival order and drops it in the other). FIX: two-pass\n22|  resolution — select the greatest tuple first, then report every\n23|  entry below it in ascending tuple order naming the final winner,\n24|  with the off-chain flag recomputed from the final winner. All\n25|  landed union assertions were order-free, so only the refusal-census\n26|  line pins moved (sessstate.go:924/927 to :929/:932).\n27|- GENERATORS: closed small alphabet, hand-written (no new dependency):\n28|  exhaustive multisets of size 0..3 with all permutations and all\n29|  ordered 2-partitions over three chain shapes, all `Compare`\n30|  pairs/triples against an independent builtin-operator oracle, all\n31|  reason sequences of length 0..2, the full presenter/observation/\n32|  operation gate table, plus seeded-random union multisets (seed\n33|  260830) and reason sequences (seed 260831) with recorded counts.\n34|- MUTANTS (`internal/sessstate/testdata/mutate_properties.py`): 8\n35|  narrowing plants (inverted tie-break, first-arrival evidence\n36|  target, dropped same-/lower-epoch losers, clock-consulting\n37|  creation and expiry, admitted same-epoch loser, admitted remote\n38|  holder), each KILLED by its named property; applied harmless\n39|  control SURVIVED; not-applied and compile-failure controls\n40|  classified separately. The expiry plant is invisible to the landed\n41|  suite (all-2026 fixtures) and only the translation property kills\n42|  it, which proves the property adds falsification power.\n43|- BOUNDS: grant age relative to the refresh policy stays authoritative\n44|  by design (only absolute clock position is non-authoritative);\n45|  malformed-union refusal evidence names the first malformed entry in\n46|  arrival order (order-independence covers well-formed inputs);\n47|  no `ax` command, doctor result, or runtime capability is claimed.\n48|- TRACEABILITY: three new acceptance cases\n49|  (`lease-ownership-union/store/gate-properties`) bound to `Reduce`,\n50|  `WinningLease`, and `Authorize`, attached to the discharged 5.3#6,\n51|  5.3#7, 2.2#1, 2.2#2, and 2.2#4 clause evidence with unchanged\n52|  coverage ratios; section:17.2 gap reworded to its narrower\n53|  reader-enum meaning; registry digest re-pinned; acceptance count\n54|  110 to 113 with the README figure and tracecheck pins updated.\n55|\n56|### TASK-260830-3g12yp — implement provider and pane fencing gates\n57|- SCOPE (`internal/fencing`): winning lease plus exact epoch before\n58|  provider activation/launch, provider input, owner-authored mutation,\n59|  checkpoint capture, and terminal restore/wrapper first start, with\n60|  terminate-stale gated on explicit force recovery. Sections 2.2, 5.3,\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
