l 13 candidate paths, `task-board.config.json`\n131|unmodified and equal to HEAD). Integration is the orchestrator's\n132|step; notes for it: (a) trunk touches none of my Go paths (only\n133|`internal/catalog*`, board files, README catalog rows, one LOGBOOK\n134|entry); (b) the only same-file adjacencies are LOGBOOK top (keep all four\n135|entries, newest-first by wall time: this 2atgj4 entry, trunk 3lt2xv\n136|11:05, 3g12yp 11:01, 2f5393 09:17, all UTC+4 2026-09-17) and the\n137|README tools table (trunk rewrote the Go-toolchain\n138|row's cataloggen command; I add a new row after the fencing row —\n139|keep both); (c) my evidence quotes the `-adopted`-neutral commands\n140|only (`go generate`, tracecheck), never command 21's explicit form.\n141|\n142|## Evidence attached\n143|\n144|- `TASK-260830-2atgj4_results.md` (this file)\n145|- `TASK-260830-2atgj4_conformance-matrix.md`\n146|- `TASK-260830-2atgj4_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (real gzip: RED/GREEN\n147|  logs, affected-package logs, validation batch logs, coverage logs,\n148|  mutants/ raw logs + mutants.json)","final_result":true}}}
